      fed rats     quality  9  ->  0.3:1   knight atk 20
      fed bandits  quality 22  ->  2.3:1   knight atk 35
      fed guards   quality 40  ->  FLAWLESS at 7v7   knight atk 56
      fed bosses   quality 46 (capped)     knight atk 63
    The early game is untouched, which was the constraint both the artifact and tools/host.js
    independently flagged: at magic 4-20 these bindings were already weak, so a flat nerf
    would have broken the early game to fix the late one.

    AND IT IS VISIBLE. The binding circle panel now states what the pile is worth, what that
    permits, and that rendering better dead raises it — a ceiling the player cannot see is not
    a mechanic, it is an unexplained nerf.

    ---- 3 of 3: the Marrow Archer grows its own bow ----
