    bandaging is built and its own comment says why it exists — "an escort you
    were paid to deliver alive", "no way to stop a beaten enemy bleeding out
    before you could take them". It was unreachable for enemies because the
    EXECUTE/SEIZE branch catches every hostile body first and returns, two
    hundred lines above it. A "neutral" faction body is not caught by that
