    her from every angle instead of glancing at a stranger in a bar.
    And the fringe sat at z 0.172 with 0.028 of depth, reaching 0.187 in front of
    a face whose surface is at 0.16: four narrow plates standing a quarter of
    their own depth off the brow, with daylight between them. That is the
    jutting.
    Taking the first option offered — "add a similar texture ALL the way around
    the head". The crown is a SHELL now: the whole skull, a second mass under it
